WEBVTT

00:00:02.700 --> 00:00:06.166
Growing up，I was always afraid of the dark
从小到大 我一直害怕黑

00:00:06.233 --> 00:00:09.400
Now I'm about to confront my deepest fears
现在我即将面对我最深的恐惧

00:00:09.400 --> 00:00:12.200
in a place where no light can reach
进入阳光找不到的地方

00:00:15.800 --> 00:00:19.566
The ocean is mysterious and vast
海洋神秘而辽阔

00:00:19.566 --> 00:00:22.233
I sense fear and loneliness
让我感觉到恐惧和孤独

00:00:22.266 --> 00:00:24.333
when i dive into the deep waters
当我潜入深海之中

00:00:24.366 --> 00:00:27.333
Will i feel isolated or free
我会感到孤立，还是自由

00:00:31.666 --> 00:00:33.633
Rock climbing is a challenge
攀岩是一项挑战

00:00:33.666 --> 00:00:36.900
Both mental and physical
无论是精神上还是身体上

00:00:36.900 --> 00:00:38.300
Can i make it to the top
我能登上顶峰吗

00:00:38.300 --> 00:00:40.733
is part of the adventure
这是冒险的一部分

00:00:40.733 --> 00:00:42.766
Where i reach my limit？
我会在何处抵达自身极限？

00:00:42.833 --> 00:00:44.566
I'm excited to find out
我很期待能找到答案

00:00:47.166 --> 00:00:50.966
This time I've come to yangshuo for rock climbing
这次我来到阳朔攀岩

00:00:51.000 --> 00:00:53.033
It involves many movements
攀岩包含许多专业动作

00:00:53.066 --> 00:00:56.433
And i want to learn how to climb in a safe manner
我想学习规范、安全的攀岩技巧

00:01:00.133 --> 00:01:02.433
What will it be like on my own
孤身前行会是怎样一番体验

00:01:02.500 --> 00:01:04.800
Will i be able to navigate my way
我能否找准前行的方向

00:01:04.800 --> 00:01:09.266
and embrace the solo journey？
坦然接纳这场独自奔赴的旅程？

00:01:10.166 --> 00:01:12.033
I am in Badain Jaran desert
我身处巴丹吉林沙漠

00:01:12.033 --> 00:01:13.833
inner Mongolia
内蒙古境内

00:01:14.933 --> 00:01:17.600
I have never been to a desert before
我从前从未踏足沙漠

00:01:17.666 --> 00:01:20.500
The vast emptiness here amazes me
这片无边旷野，令我心生震撼